<div class="hqr-shell">
<header class="hqr-banner"><i class="fa-solid fa-box-archive"></i><div><h2>Quest & Faction Library</h2><p>Transfer reusable definitions between Worlds.</p></div></header>
<div class="hqr-scroll">
<section class="hqr-panel"><h3>Export Library</h3><p>Export all Faction profiles, ranks, benefit definitions, and reusable Quest definitions and required Item sources in one JSON file. Results, recipients and payment history remain private to this World.</p><button type="button" data-action="export"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-export"></i> Export JSON</button></section>
<section class="hqr-panel"><h3>Import Library</h3><p>Creates new Factions and Quests as Unavailable. Matches Faction references within the file. Existing Journals will not be overwritten. Importing the same library again skips records already created from it.</p><label>Choose JSON Library<input type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label><label class="hqr-check"><input type="checkbox" name="applySettings"> Also apply Folder and Class settings (only when matching sources are installed)</label><button type="button" class="hqr-primary" data-action="import"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-import"></i> Import JSON</button></section>
</div></div>
